1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:07,267
You wrote a paragraph. Now you rewrite it by hand, or paste it into a chat window and copy it back.

2
00:00:07,433 --> 00:00:08,633
There's a faster loop.

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:13,933
Pick a command. Proofread, rewrite, professional, concise.

4
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:19,333
The text rewrites itself, in place. Undo puts the original back.

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,867
Docs, Slack, VS Code, your mail. Same gesture, every time.

6
00:00:25,033 --> 00:00:28,967
Write your own commands. Reorder, back up, share them.

7
00:00:29,133 --> 00:00:32,500
Cloud or local, and a different model per command.

8
00:00:32,667 --> 00:00:45,367
Under the hood: a global hotkey listener, one adapter per provider, and a writer that edits the app directly. Accessibility API on macOS, no clipboard round trip.

9
00:00:45,533 --> 00:00:51,700
No telemetry. Keys in your OS keychain. Your text goes only to the provider you picked.

10
00:00:51,867 --> 00:00:56,333
Free, open source, on macOS, Windows and Linux.

11
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,633
AI Shortcuts.
